1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,486
Overloading against overriding.

2
00:00:02,486 --> 00:00:08,307
Overloading is in one class, with different signatures, resolved at compile time.

3
00:00:08,307 --> 00:00:17,434
Overriding redefines a base function in a derived class with the identical signature, resolved at run time, and needs the word virtual.

4
00:00:17,434 --> 00:00:23,763
Objects interact by sending messages: calling a member function on a named object.

